==[[Range/Lore|The Range's lore assets]]==
===[[Range/Lore/V26|Season 2026]]===
*{{AC|VoicemailBrimstone123.mp3}} "Brim, look at [[Sage|her]]. Look at how banged up she was today! I respect Sage too much to feel sorry for her but... there's a limit to how much one person can take. She's hitting that limit and the rest of the team can feel it. Look, I'm no Sage, hmm, jebiga, I'm no [[Skye]] either but... I'm better than nothing, we could use the extra healing backup. Next mission, the mission after, I'm there. It's gonna be hell but we've got this."
*{{AC|VoicemailBrimstone125.mp3}} "People have filed complaints? You mean [[Vyse]]. Brim, come on, is she serious? It's like complaining that a dog barks. It's a dog! Now she wants a sound guy who makes no sound. I already wear my hoodie and my gloves, how else can I dampen the noise?! Ugh, okay, okay here's what we'll do. Starting now, no more loud music in the personnel quarters. [[Raze]] and whoever else can jam with me in another area! And that way Vyse can read her romance novels in peace. And everybody's happy! Good talk, Brim, good talk."
*{{AC|VoicemailBrimstone127.mp3}} "Brim, this sucks. You know it, I know it. It's not just the physical injuries, it's-... it's the mental fatigue, everyone's just so... down. But nothing we say will make a difference at this point so when words can't help you gotta get creative. Let's fly the VLT/R to rush in some proper pizza. I know! I know, but it could really make a difference. Food is the most basic form of comfort, and that's what everyone needs right now. We don't throw a party or make it a whole thing, we just pick it up, set it out, and let the smell of piping hot pizza do the rest of the work. Seriously. And let me know if you want my help picking toppings."
*{{AC|VoicemailBrimstone135.mp3}} "Brim, here's an update for you. [[Sage]] just kicked my ass in the gym. Everyone told me she was good but... I had no idea she was this good! It's like she evolves, from Sage to... I don't know, Battle Sage. She's still dealing with the, uh, crystallization, but I'm telling you, she is in her element right now. Injuries or not, I dare anyone to mess with her now!"

